    <title>Africa Climate Talks call for stronger negotiating capacity and implementation-focused COP32 in Addis Ababa</title>
    <link>https://www.uneca.org/stories/africa-climate-talks-call-for-stronger-negotiating-capacity-and-implementation-focused-cop32</link>
